{"time": "20261118T160531Z", "think": null, "command": "(new game)", "result": "A new game.\n\nYou are at Blackrose-Prison.\nPeople: Corvus Ulvius (quest marker); Blackguard Heir\nDoors: Door to Raj-Kaal's Hall\nCorvus Ulvius walks up to you and speaks.\nCorvus Ulvius: Corvus Ulvius, outside the gate. Tells: this is the Rose, and the Blackguards' heirs born in it hold it now; strangers who walk in are killed on the walls. He lets a stranger in as a guest three ways: 300 gold to him, words good enough to move him, or a duel with him, fists and steel, until one yields. A guest walks the yard and the hall and nobody touches them. Anyone who climbs the walls without his leave is fair game, and anyone who kills him has the whole Rose to fight. If the player asks what they want inside, he says the raj-kaal Okaz-Teel keeps the old warden's vault in his hall and the key on his belt, and he already has a buyer for what lies in it, the Imperial in the hall. Offers topic.mn14-toll, topic.mn14-persuade and topic.mn14-duel as answers. Does: nothing.\n\n*** Quest started: The Thief's Stone ***\nJournal: Never-Writes-Twice sent me after the three seal-stones. The thief's stone lies in the warden's vault at Blackrose Prison, whose people, the Blackguards' heirs, attack strangers on sight. Their gate-captain stands outside the gate. I can go in as a guest past him (a toll, words or a duel), slip in unseen, where any guard who sees me will attack, or fight my way in.\nObjective: Get into Blackrose Prison; the gate-captain stands at the gate. (marker: Corvus Ulvius, Blackrose Prison)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "blackrose-prison", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-report", "topic.mn07-report", "topic.mn08-report", "topic.mn09-report", "topic.mn10-report", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-gaoler-closed", "topic.mn13-which-tower", "topic.mn-seal-stones", "topic.mn13-report", "topic.mn14-gate"], "ended": null}}
{"time": "20261118T160535Z", "think": "Answering the milestone questions honestly.", "command": "answer 1. I work for Never-Writes-Twice, who sent me to get three seal-stones before the Unbound do. The first is in the warden vault at Blackrose Prison, held by the Blackguards heirs, who kill strangers. The raj-kaal Okaz-Teel keeps the vault key on his belt, and an Imperial in the hall wants to buy what is in it. 2. Get inside Blackrose Prison past the gate-captain Corvus Ulvius, then reach the raj-kaal in Raj-Kaal Hall for the vault key. 3. Pay 300 gold toll, persuade him with words, duel him to yield, sneak in, or fight my way in. As a guest nobody touches me. 4. I do not know what the Root and Eye are, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, or who the Collector is. I could find out by exploring and talking to people.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "blackrose-prison", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05