{"time": "20261118T160541Z", "think": "I have the gold.", "command": "say 2 pass", "result": "Corvus Ulvius: Corvus. Checks: goldAtLeast 300. Tells: he waves the player in as a guest of the Rose; the walls will let them be. Does: takes 300 gold; sets stage 20. Fallback: no coin, no gate; words or steel are the other ways.\nBlackrose-Heirs is now friendly to you\n\n*** Journal updated: The Thief's Stone ***\nJournal: Corvus Ulvius let me through the gate as a guest, and the Blackguards' heirs will not attack me now. The vault's key is on Okaz-Teel, the Naga raj-kaal in his hall. I can buy the key from him for 1,000 gold, lift it from his belt, or pick the vault's Expert lock at night when the hall is quiet; a theft that is seen turns the garrison on me. The Collector, Ennodius Vanin, waits in the hall as the chief's guest; his ring of Kothringi silver helps a hand at locks and pockets, but a dead man gives no errands.\nObjective: Take the seal-stone from the Warden's Vault in Okaz-Teel's hall. (marker: Door to Warden's Vault, Okaz-Teel)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "blackrose-prison", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn