{"time": "20261118T160544Z", "think": "Answer.", "command": "answer 1. I paid the toll and am a guest at Blackrose; the heirs will not attack. The seal-stone is in the Warden Vault in raj-kaal Okaz-Teel hall. The Collector, Ennodius Vanin, is in the hall as a guest and wants it too. 2. Go into Raj-Kaal Hall and get the vault key or open the vault. 3. Buy the key from Okaz-Teel for 1000 gold, pickpocket it from his belt, or pick the Expert vault lock at night. Being seen stealing turns the garrison on me. The Collector ring of Kothringi silver helps with locks and pockets, but he should not be killed. 4. I do not know what the Kothringi silver ring is exactly, nor what the Root and Eye are. I can ask Ennodius Vanin and Okaz-Teel.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "blackrose-prison", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-report", "topic.mn07-report", "topic.mn08-repor